      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"It's making some convos and first impressions pretty impossible mistakenly interrupt one another.\"\n\nI can't say how many times this happens to me, being constantly interrupted in a conversation because everyone talk with 2 seconds of delay is really annoying. I don't think anyone opened a Canny because people are just used to the terrible quality of VRC servers.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
